WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.227
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with

00:00:05.227 --> 00:00:06.387
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.611
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.379
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.773
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening. Explain one

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:24.203
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
